Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 "please red the multiscale dynamics  nb and then explain the sensory field ( \
how it creates determnistic structures of hyperdimensional information  etc \
etc etc ... please explain the full vision and functionality Multiscale \
Resonance, Stability, and Field-Topology Notebook v3\nThis notebook is a ",
 StyleBox["deep rewrite and full review",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " of the previous framework.\nIt is designed to be: \n",
 StyleBox["modular",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["inspectable",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["symbolic-first where possible",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["numerically testable where necessary",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["explicit about what is established, what is modeled, and what \
remains speculative",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\nIt does ",
 StyleBox["not",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " assume that broad metaphysical claims are already proven.\nInstead, it \
organizes the framework into a sequence of rigorous mathematical test layers. \
\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"214126ce-ba18-8b4a-9134-1462cef8afd8"],
 "\n0. Epistemic policy\nThis notebook uses four labels throughout: \n",
 StyleBox["Established",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": standard mathematics or physics already well defined.\n",
 StyleBox["Model hypothesis",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": a proposed structure that can be tested.\n",
 StyleBox["Analogy",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": a structural resemblance between different systems.\n",
 StyleBox["Speculation",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": an interpretation not derivable from the current mathematics.\nThe \
purpose of this notebook is to keep the first two computationally rigorous. \n\
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"957c5e64-a05b-0247-be9a-92185f538420"],
 "\n1. Conceptual core\nThe framework is decomposed into six distinct \
sectors:\n1. ",
 StyleBox["Geometry and substrate",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "2. ",
 StyleBox["Local dynamics and spectral persistence",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "3. ",
 StyleBox["Scale transformations and robustness",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "4. ",
 StyleBox["Selection stability under repeated interaction",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "5. ",
 StyleBox["Field topology, circulation, and equilibrium pockets",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "6. ",
 StyleBox["Cross-scale transfer and synthesis diagnostics",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "This separation prevents multiple different mechanisms from being collapsed \
into one undefined word such as \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]vortex,\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]measurement,\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] or \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]stability.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2a44018a-8bea-cf4e-a3ab-1620eec5f406"],
 "\n2. Corrected terminology\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   PaneBox[
    StyleBox[
     TagBox[
      TagBox[GridBox[{
         {
          TagBox["\<\"Informal phrase\"\>",
           HoldForm], 
          TagBox["\<\"Rigorous replacement\"\>",
           HoldForm]},
         {"\<\"surrounding indifference\"\>", "\<\"ambient low-gradient \
background / background symmetry field\"\>"},
         {"\<\"information density\"\>", "\<\"source density / effective \
energy density / state density\"\>"},
         {"\<\"sweet spot\"\>", "\<\"equilibrium pocket / metastable basin / \
resonance island\"\>"},
         {"\<\"vortex\"\>", "\<\"field circulation / phase winding / rotating \
mode structure / helical pattern\"\>"},
         {"\<\"dimensional lattice tension field\"\>", "\<\"coupled \
multiscale field network\"\>"},
         {"\<\"location by resonance\"\>", "\<\"modal overlap / phase-coded \
relational state\"\>"},
         {"\<\"measured into existence\"\>", "\<\"persistence under \
interaction / channel-stable realization\"\>"},
         {"\<\"self-measurement\"\>", "\<\"internal feedback / recurrent \
state selection\"\>"}
        },
        GridBoxAlignment->{
         "Columns" -> {Left, {Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
        GridBoxDividers->{
         "Columns" -> {{False}}, "Rows" -> {False, True, {False}, False}},
        GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
            Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
             Offset[2.0999999999999996`]}, 
            Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
            Offset[0.2], {
             Offset[0.4]}, 
            Offset[0.2]}}],
       {None, OutputFormsDump`HeadedColumns}],
      Function[BoxForm`e$, 
       TableForm[
       BoxForm`e$, 
        TableHeadings -> {
         None, {"Informal phrase", "Rigorous replacement"}}]]], "Text",
     StripOnInput->False,
     ShowStringCharacters->False],
    ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 5}}],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 5}}]], "TextTableForm", "Text",ExpressionUUID->
  "71dca90b-8618-294c-9007-9cc639ce649b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"3391187a-c2c3-fb47-b26b-8f3d9d3c14f9"],
 "\n3. Setup\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"$Assumptions", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Element", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "x", ",", "y", ",", "z", ",", "t", ",", "r", ",", "\[Theta]", ",", 
          "\[Phi]", ",", "u", ",", "v", ",", "s", ",", "k", ",", "q", ",", 
          "\[Omega]", ",", "\[Gamma]", ",", "\[Alpha]", ",", "\[Beta]", ",", 
          "\[CurlyEpsilon]", ",", "\[CapitalOmega]"}], "}"}], ",", "Reals"}], 
       "]"}], "&&", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ">=", "0"}], "&&", 
      RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ">=", "0"}], "&&", 
      RowBox[{"\[Beta]", ">=", "0"}], "&&", 
      RowBox[{"\[CurlyEpsilon]", ">", "0"}]}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coords1", "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", "x", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coords2", "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coords3", "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coords4", "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", "x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
  ExpressionUUID->"f06d4c34-e0b0-b44c-b757-fa3ee885b649"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"65ea95f1-8270-9c4f-a192-12bb9084a746"],
 "\n4. Geometry and substrate layer\n4.1 Parametric geometries\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
     RowBox[{"sphereParam", ",", "torusEmbedding", ",", "radialDistance"}], 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sphereParam", "[", "\[Rho]_", "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Theta]_", ",", "\[Phi]_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]", "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"torusEmbedding", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"majorRadius_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"minorRadius_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"u_", ",", "v_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"majorRadius", "+", 
          RowBox[{"minorRadius", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "v", "]"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "u", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"majorRadius", "+", 
          RowBox[{"minorRadius", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "v", "]"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "u", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"minorRadius", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "v", "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"radialDistance", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x0_", ",", "y0_"}], "}"}], "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"x_", ",", "y_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"x", "-", "x0"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"y", "-", "y0"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], 
  "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7a277a14-a1ff-4c4d-aa38-a57400574ea6"],
 "\n4.2 Interpretation\nSphere-like geometry is suitable for shell-like or \
isotropic closed systems.\nTorus-like geometry is suitable for recirculating, \
looped, or doubly periodic organization.\nLattices and graphs are suitable \
for discrete coupled systems.\nThese are modeling choices, not universal \
identities. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"eee33732-b571-d943-bd5b-3276e74d9b14"],
 "\n5. Local dynamics and spectral persistence\nA broad class of systems is \
modeled by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], "2"], 
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], "+", "2", "\[Gamma] ", 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], "+", 
         StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], "+", 
         StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["u", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["f", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\partial_t^2 u + 2\\gamma\\,\\partial_t u + \\mathcal{L}u + \
\\mathcal{N}(u) = f", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c4f4911b-3c51-e24d-9170-bac9116ee8ed"],
 "where: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["u", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "u", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0df12762-29f3-9b4d-ab9f-3f7827ce334f"],
 " is the state field,\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["L", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{L}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1647949a-891c-e343-b303-6fd582576381"],
 " is the linear operator,\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["N", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{N}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c0f00318-3586-1b4b-935c-243f7e7b0894"],
 " is nonlinear coupling,\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["f", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "f", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "abaa29e7-a499-7442-9508-21d10c0c0c1d"],
 " is forcing,\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Gamma]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\gamma", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5c40b2ae-2588-014f-94a5-bb08e77e3317"],
 " is damping.\n5.1 Matrix surrogates and spectral diagnostics\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
     "dampedLaplacian1D", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "spectralData", ",",
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "truncationStabilityTable", ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "qFactor", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "  ", "modeEnergy"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"dampedLaplacian1D", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"n_Integer", "?", "Positive"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "lap", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lap", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "        ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", 
               RowBox[{"-", "2"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "        ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", "1"}], ",", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "        ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", "1"}]}], 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", "}"}], ",", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"n", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
           "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "Normal"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"lap", "-", 
         RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}]}]}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"spectralData", "[", 
      RowBox[{"matrix_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "vals", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"vals", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
          RowBox[{"N", " ", "@", " ", "matrix"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "->", "vals"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<RealParts\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"Re", "[", "vals", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<ImaginaryParts\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"Im", "[", "vals", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<ContinuousTimeStableQ\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"And", " ", "@@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Re", "[", "vals", "]"}], "<", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<DiscreteTimeStableQ\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"And", " ", "@@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vals", "]"}], "<", "1"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<StabilityMarginContinuous\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"-", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Re", "[", "vals", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<StabilityMarginDiscrete\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vals", "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "|>"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"truncationStabilityTable", "[", 
      RowBox[{"operatorBuilder_", ",", "modeCounts_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"spectralData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"operatorBuilder", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
       "modeCounts"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"qFactor", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[Omega]_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], " ", "/;", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ">", "0"}]}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Gamma]"}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"qFactor", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[Omega]_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], ":=", 
     "Infinity"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"modeEnergy", "[", 
     RowBox[{"a_", ",", "adot_", ",", 
      RowBox[{"\[Omega]_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"adot", "^", "2"}], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"a", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
  ExpressionUUID->"3feed12f-11a2-cc45-9c21-4193ce883196"],
 "\n5.2 Spectral test suite\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "spectralConvergenceReport", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"spectralConvergenceReport", "[", 
     RowBox[{"operatorBuilder_", ",", "modeCounts_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"table", ",", "margins"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"table", "=", 
        RowBox[{"truncationStabilityTable", "[", 
         RowBox[{"operatorBuilder", ",", "modeCounts"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"margins", "=", 
        RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"table", "[", "#", "]"}], 
            "[", "\"\<StabilityMarginContinuous\>\"", "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
          "modeCounts"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<Table\>\"", "->", "table"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
          "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Margins\>\"", "->", "margins"}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ConvergentMarginQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Quiet", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
             RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Values", "[", "margins", "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"10", "^", 
                 RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "<=", "3"}], 
           "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "|>"}]}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "cf3c8fab-d882-e449-9035-3cb9d0170ece"],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Rigorous test:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " spectral conclusions should not drift arbitrarily as truncation changes. \n\
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a2749ea6-37e3-a248-826d-eae2a6e89959"],
 "\n6. PDE eigenmode layer\nThis is the more rigorous route for continuous \
systems. \n6.1 One-dimensional Sturm\[Dash]Liouville example\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "oneDPDEEigensystem", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"oneDPDEEigensystem", "[", 
     RowBox[{"n_Integer", "?", "Positive"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
    RowBox[{"NDEigensystem", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"u", "''"}], "[", "x", "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "      ", 
        RowBox[{"DirichletCondition", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"u", "[", "x", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x", "==", "0"}], "||", 
           RowBox[{"x", "==", "1"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "    ", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"u", "[", "x", "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "    ", "n"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
  ExpressionUUID->"73119f2e-3992-8f41-815c-e93b8de0a5d2"],
 "\n6.2 Two-dimensional circular membrane example\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
     RowBox[{"circularRegion", ",", "circularModes"}], "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"circularRegion", "=", 
     RowBox[{"Disk", "[", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"circularModes", "[", 
     RowBox[{"n_Integer", "?", "Positive"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
    RowBox[{"NDEigensystem", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         RowBox[{"Laplacian", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"u", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
        RowBox[{"DirichletCondition", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"u", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", "True"}], 
         "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "}"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"u", "[", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "}"}], " ", "\[Element]", " ", 
       "circularRegion"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "n"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "04150c1c-c239-6a4a-acdd-be0ec4760745"],
 "\n6.3 Interpretation\nThis is the rigorous meaning of \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]resonant cavity structure\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for \
bounded domains: \nthe geometry determines the operator,\nthe operator \
determines the eigenmodes,\nthe eigenmodes determine admissible standing \
patterns,\ndamping and forcing determine persistence.\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"8fbfe08a-8416-a74d-96c6-979a6ff588c9"],
 "\n7. Scale transformations and robustness\n7.1 Corrected coarse-graining\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
     "dyadicCoarseGrain", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "dyadicLift", ",",
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "rgOrbit", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "  ", "scaleResiduals", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      "fixedScaleResidual", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      "scaleFixedPointData"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"dyadicCoarseGrain", "[", "list_List", "]"}], " ", "/;", " ", 
      RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "list", "]"}], "]"}]}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Mean", " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
       RowBox[{"list", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"dyadicLift", "[", "list_List", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Riffle", "[", 
      RowBox[{"list", ",", "list"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgOrbit", "[", 
      RowBox[{"transform_", ",", "state_List", ",", 
       RowBox[{"steps_Integer", "?", "NonNegative"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"NestWhileList", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"transform", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"N", " ", "@", " ", "state"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], "&&", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "#", "]"}], ">", "1"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ",
        "steps"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"scaleResiduals", "[", 
      RowBox[{"state_List", ",", 
       RowBox[{"steps_Integer", ":", " ", "8"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"orbit", ",", "normalizedOrbit"}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
         RowBox[{"rgOrbit", "[", 
          RowBox[{"dyadicCoarseGrain", ",", "state", ",", "steps"}], "]"}]}], 
        ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"normalizedOrbit", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#", ",", "Norm"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
          "orbit"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Norm", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"dyadicCoarseGrain", "[", 
                RowBox[{"normalizedOrbit", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "Norm"}], "]"}], 
             "-", 
             RowBox[{"normalizedOrbit", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"i", "+", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", "2"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           "    ", "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", "1", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "normalizedOrbit", "]"}], "-", "1"}]}], 
           "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}]}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"fixedScaleResidual", "[", "state_List", "]"}], " ", "/;", " ", 
      RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "state", "]"}], "]"}]}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"coarse", ",", "lifted"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"coarse", "=", 
         RowBox[{"dyadicCoarseGrain", "[", "state", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"lifted", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"dyadicLift", "[", "coarse", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "state", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lifted", ",", "Norm"}], "]"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
            RowBox[{"state", ",", "Norm"}], "]"}]}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"scaleFixedPointData", "[", 
     RowBox[{"state_List", ",", 
      RowBox[{"steps_Integer", ":", " ", "8"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"tol_", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"orbit", ",", "residuals"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
       "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
        RowBox[{"rgOrbit", "[", 
         RowBox[{"dyadicCoarseGrain", ",", "state", ",", "steps"}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"residuals", "=", 
        RowBox[{"scaleResiduals", "[", 
         RowBox[{"state", ",", "steps"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "  ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<Orbit\>\"", "->", "orbit"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
          "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Residuals\>\"", "->", "residuals"}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<FinalResidual\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"residuals", "===", 
             RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "0", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Last", "[", "residuals", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<FixedPointQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"residuals", "===", 
             RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "True", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Last", "[", "residuals", "]"}], "<", "tol"}]}], 
           "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "|>"}]}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "75803e0c-0003-7347-a1c4-b85de9d6f8a8"],
 "\n7.2 Rigorous scale tests\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "scaleTestReport", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"scaleTestReport", "[", 
     RowBox[{"state_List", ",", 
      RowBox[{"steps_Integer", ":", " ", "8"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"tol_", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "data", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"data", "=", 
        RowBox[{"scaleFixedPointData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"state", ",", "steps", ",", "tol"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<ScaleData\>\"", "->", "data"}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ResidualMonotonicNonincreaseQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"OrderedQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", 
            RowBox[{"data", "[", "\"\<Residuals\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<FixedPointQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"data", "[", "\"\<FixedPointQ\>\"", "]"}]}]}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "|>"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "a6a9370b-2d59-174c-8cdf-dc2f1c80ff16"],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Important:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " scale invariance must be tested by a defined coarse-graining map, not by \
subtracting incompatible state vectors. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0850fe5d-79ea-b04c-b239-0128b62f73fc"],
 "\n8. Selection stability under repeated interaction\nThis is the rigorous \
implementation of a simple decohering or state-selection channel. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
     "dephasingChannel", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "phaseUnitary", ",",
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "selfMeasurementStep", ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "pointerModeData", ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "quasiPeriodicSchedule", ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "densityEntropy"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"dephasingChannel", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"state_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"p_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"diag", ",", "offDiag"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"diag", "=", 
         RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "state", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"offDiag", "=", 
         RowBox[{"state", "-", "diag"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"diag", "+", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", "p"}], ")"}], " ", "offDiag"}]}]}]}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"phaseUnitary", "[", "phases_List", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
       RowBox[{"I", " ", "phases"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"selfMeasurementStep", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"state_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", "phases_List", ",", 
       RowBox[{"p_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "u", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"u", "=", 
         RowBox[{"phaseUnitary", "[", "phases", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"dephasingChannel", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"u", " ", ".", " ", "state", " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "u", "]"}]}], ",", "p"}], 
         "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"pointerModeData", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"initialState_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", "phaseSchedule_List", ",", 
       RowBox[{"p_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "orbit", ",", "finalState", ",", "weights", ",", "coherenceNorms"}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
         RowBox[{"FoldList", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"selfMeasurementStep", "[", 
             RowBox[{"#1", ",", "#2", ",", "p"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
           "initialState", ",", "phaseSchedule"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"finalState", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Last", "[", "orbit", "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"weights", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Chop", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "finalState", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"coherenceNorms", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#", "-", 
               RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
             "2"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "orbit"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Orbit\>\"", "->", "orbit"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<FinalState\>\"", "->", "finalState"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<PointerWeights\>\"", "->", "weights"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<DominantPointerIndex\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"First", " ", "@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Ordering", "[", 
             RowBox[{"weights", ",", 
              RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<CoherenceNorms\>\"", "->", "coherenceNorms"}]}], 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "|>"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"quasiPeriodicSchedule", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"steps_Integer", "?", "Positive"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"dim_Integer", "?", "Positive"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"n", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "j", "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", "dim"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"n", ",", "1", ",", "steps"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"densityEntropy", "[", 
     RowBox[{"state_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "vals", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"vals", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Chop", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
          RowBox[{"N", " ", "@", " ", "state"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{"vals", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"#", ">", "0"}], " ", "&"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
            RowBox[{"vals", ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", ">", "0"}], " ", "&"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
         "]"}]}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
  ExpressionUUID->"c5eab49f-90b9-8045-a0f4-4a1f743ec28e"],
 "\n8.1 Rigorous selection tests\n",
 Cell[BoxData[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "selectionTestReport", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"selectionTestReport", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"initialState_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", "phaseSchedule_List", ",", 
      RowBox[{"p_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"data", ",", "entropies"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"data", "=", 
        RowBox[{"pointerModeData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"initialState", ",", "phaseSchedule", ",", "p"}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"entropies", "=", 
        RowBox[{"densityEntropy", " ", "/@", " ", 
         RowBox[{"data", "[", "\"\<Orbit\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<SelectionData\>\"", "->", "data"}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<EntropyHistory\>\"", "->", "entropies"}], ",", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<CoherenceDecayQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"OrderedQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", 
            RowBox[{"data", "[", "\"\<CoherenceNorms\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
           "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<PointerDominanceQ\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"data", "[", "\"\<PointerWeights\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ">", 
           RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
        "|>"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
  ExpressionUUID->"786c5fbd-cbaa-fc44-b2f2-99a41c1015fb"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
