 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"6c104318-b743-234b-90a0-59529c593b7b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "cross-scale transforms"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"5e425a2a-2de3-874f-b993-398d880faae6"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"L2: realized physical or observational structure\"\>", 
    "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d3c6c9e2-400b-f844-b352-df53ee73c914"],
 "\nThis corresponds to: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "stable modes,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"79d1efa3-eb72-5845-8b76-8f23e545f598"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "scale-fixed structures,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"08b8438e-f90e-574d-9067-ec9ff3281f0c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "selected pointer states,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"c0dbaac8-53a7-5146-85fb-7d7dda3f22b5"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "equilibrium pockets,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"cac25346-afc1-7a41-94ea-705ad13b9bb2"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "circulation/topological patterns."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"f3cad8c4-c540-ce4d-9b99-1709ac2e58b1"],
 "\nSo the notebook is almost a ",
 StyleBox["bridge formalism",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ":\nit does not prove ontology, but it gives a computational route from \
substrate to persistent realizations. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"78d51efa-fd1a-2943-af27-c4f4e894cf26"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox[Cell[TextData[{
     "9. What the notebook does ",
     StyleBox["not",
      FontSlant->Italic],
     " yet prove"
    }],
     Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"364ec818-c7d4-a046-88d5-7e4c40feca4e"],
     "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"eac359b2-2169-8e4d-8cba-90a5c5e49d6c"],
 "\nThis is equally important.\n\nThe notebook does ",
 StyleBox["not",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " yet prove: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that consciousness is fundamental,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"5e302689-74ee-e243-8783-cebacd189d9f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that all matter is sensory-field condensation,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"23e236f6-f1c4-2f4a-855b-2af93e9a14e5"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that the substrate is literally infinite-dimensional in a metaphysical \
sense,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"97989560-2cd1-ca4d-97e1-97ab29f8866b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that all stable resonances correspond to meaningful observables,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"04cd586e-b424-164a-997d-8b1bacdb6794"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that topological circulation is equivalent to semantic information,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"0b617292-3c68-4446-b3c9-b228822af70c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "that selection stability is identical to measurement in a full physical \
theory."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"eebd9c01-8b03-c94e-bd85-ff844bc0b585"],
 "\nThose are beyond the present mathematics.\n\nThe notebook itself is \
honest about this, and that honesty is one of its strengths. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"bd1cdfec-8360-3d4c-9f0a-292a268e5726"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"10. The best rigorous explanation of the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]full vision\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"aee419c0-6314-304f-87d5-4f5bb5f0ac9c"],
 "\nHere is the clearest version I can give: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Full vision\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"382efe31-c970-b445-9deb-1fa71632f557"],
 "\nThe notebook proposes that complex structured reality should be analyzed \
as the joint outcome of several independently testable mechanisms: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["resonance",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determines what can persist,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"22353a70-6490-fc48-9a22-d6667479c6c2"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["stability",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determines what does persist,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"81510a4f-5696-0f49-aa2d-557aca7c8553"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["scale robustness",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determines what remains identifiable across resolution,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"166f2c67-79ec-3648-9a67-c4b7fa674513"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["selection dynamics",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determine what survives repeated interaction,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"01d6fc3f-dfa9-a941-bf23-750dc5d64ec3"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["field topology",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determines how structures localize, circulate, and organize spatially,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"2db2ae0e-20aa-5b4b-9314-8a61666aac03"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["cross-scale synthesis",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " determines whether these mechanisms cooperate."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"722b516e-bcf5-4741-adf6-38d36d54a7dc"],
 "\nUnder that view, the sensory field is the total coupled medium in which \
these mechanisms operate.\n\nIt \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]creates deterministic \
structures\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] not by magical collapse, but by repeatedly \
narrowing a huge possibility space into a smaller family of: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "persistent,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"a7eaa3b1-9ab8-2743-8cdd-b67b5e0a3279"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "reproducible,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"019ea3c9-cd5a-0d48-8e12-804c3a94ed4c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "metastable,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"94564afc-04f6-6547-aa08-3f4dafd6facb"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "topologically meaningful,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"9f8c3e1a-2a70-a14e-84d3-0b7274c21034"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "interaction-selected forms."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"c18b05ea-4b12-7449-b318-b4d169bef9b5"],
 "\nThat is the full functionality. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"206a1f89-9f41-d249-8366-65d66c861de9"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"11. A sharper one-paragraph formulation\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"01f88461-e9a2-0740-a7bb-e2c1d6c5d06c"],
 "\nIf you want a condensed statement: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"The sensory field in this notebook is a multiscale \
relational medium whose geometry, spectral operators, interaction rules, and \
topology jointly select which high-dimensional configurations become stable \
realized structures. Deterministic organization emerges when a pattern is \
resonantly supported, stable under dynamics, robust under scale \
transformation, preserved under repeated interaction, and localized within a \
coherent field-topological landscape such as basins or circulation \
structures.\"\>",
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[1], 
         GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
         LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
          RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
         AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], 
  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1b4ff746-c49e-6f45-95ae-e26021ac9e31"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
