 "\nwithout pretending the metaphysics is already established.\n\nSo if you \
ask, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]what is the sensory \
field?\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the best answer is: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"It is the organized dynamical medium of relational \
sensitivity and persistence from which stable multiscale structures can be \
selected.\"\>",
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
