 "\nAnd if you ask, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]how does it create deterministic \
hyperdimensional structures?\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the best answer is: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"By constraining and filtering a high-dimensional state \
space through geometry, spectral admissibility, damping, scale invariance \
tests, recurrent selection, and topological organization until only robust \
structured modes remain.\"\>",
