  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[Infinity]"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              StyleBox["V", "TI"], ")"}], "-", 
            StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
             StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "(", 
            StyleBox["V", "TI"], ")"}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\frac{dq}{dt} = \\frac{q_\\infty(V)-q}{\\tau_q(V)}", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4caf30d3-a522-054e-b6af-5cc420610b07"],
 "with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> InterpretationBox["", 
       Failure[
       "TeXAssistantError", <|
        "MessageTemplate" -> "Errors: `Errors`", 
         "MessageParameters" -> <|"Errors" -> {}|>, "Input" -> 
         "q_\\infty(V) = \\frac{\\alpha_q(V)}{\\alpha_q(V)+\\beta_q(V)}, \
\\qquad\n\\tau_q(V) = \\\:0aab\:0580...rallly, a neuron module might expose:\n\
\n- full simulation mode,\n- reduced differentiable mode,\n- sparse \
event-driven mode,\n- measurement-aware mode,\n- closure-regularized mode.\n\n\
This series will later define these precisely.\n\n---\n\n## 14. Stability and \
linearization\n\n### 14.1. Equilibria\n\nAn equilibrium"|>]], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> 
