Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["17. What this notebook establishes", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"86f9bd20-d3b2-9a49-9555-1243e3fe5216"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook establishes the formal biophysical basis of the neuron series.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3dfddc5a-34b3-4344-bdd9-ce27eb15ecc7"],

Cell["Its main achievements are:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aa5b1781-3d12-474f-a934-916218348f5f"],

Cell["1. defining the neuron as a state-space system,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"81e3a4cb-596b-a24c-be3f-4e28686b1240"],

Cell["2. organizing a strict model ladder,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4f3c80d4-fdec-534a-91f3-98c1f6beaead"],

Cell["\<\
3. deriving passive, spiking, conductance-based, and cable-style foundations,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e5c99d57-9cc5-9b40-b3c9-2c4203813f20"],

Cell["\<\
4. identifying the path from rich biology to digital approximations,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2a6326d9-5c3e-1e4f-874e-6bf235bb9fe4"],

Cell["\<\
5. opening a disciplined channel for RHUFT-compatible measurement and closure \
variables.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4e17de2e-9c8d-c64b-a2c3-8a8d2b582d7e"],

Cell["\<\
This is the correct mathematical foundation for later notebooks. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"284f5ea4-b0b6-d34b-9ee1-cb5b243bcbd8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
